cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "XRL-LLM: Explainable Reinforcement Learning with Natural-Language Justifications for Volt/VAR Control"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of XRL-LLM, which couples an interpretability-aware
  PPO agent for Volt/VAR control with exact grouped Shapley attribution and
  domain-grounded large language model explanations. Includes the IEEE 33-bus
  study, robustness tests, transfer to the IEEE 69-bus feeder, trained agents
  and numerical result records.
